    "sourceUrl": "https://www.seymourduncan.com/images/wiring-diagrams/Esq_Standard.pdf",
    "permission": "Seymour Duncan encourages sharing these wiring diagrams freely; commercial use requires prior written permission. LIMITATIONS: Source position 3 needs a 0.05 uF capacitor in series with a 3.3 kOhm resistor. This model has no resistor and supports only 3.9, 12, 22, or 47 nF capacitors; that branch is omitted. App neck/both/bridge = source 1/2/3, so neck and bridge are now identical (no tone/roll-off). Bridge ground ends at volume casing; no bridge terminal."
  },
